And we're here to help make the start of your day.

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:29.940
Just a little bit brighter, right, Clark?

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:32.420
Right, a little less brighter.

00:00:33.899 --> 00:00:36.670
Could we start over?

00:00:37.049 --> 00:00:38.829
No problem. Just let me know when you're ready.

00:00:39.429 --> 00:00:39.670
Great.

00:00:41.899 --> 00:00:43.979
