00:00:44.479 --> 00:00:47.359
I'm still angry. You didn't tell me how Ballet Oliver was doing, but you're here anyway.

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:49.439
So please, don't make me wish you weren't.

00:00:49.439 --> 00:00:51.439
It's okay, Lois. Just, you don't need to get it.

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:52.780
all worked up like you usually do.

00:00:53.659 --> 00:00:56.939
Well, excuse me, Mr. I'm slow and steady and know what's best for everyone.

