With newspapers on the Endangered Species List, news television is my one and only backup plan.

00:01:03.899 --> 00:01:06.540
Don't you think you'd be a little less dramatic with this whole thing?

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:09.659
You could be a little more passionate with this whole thing.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:11.819
But not you, not mild-mannered Clark Kent.

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:13.780
Do you even care if I get this job?

00:01:14.180 --> 00:01:15.939
Of course I care. I bought a new tie.

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:17.760
