00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:43.819
Thanks, guys. That'll do.

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:46.299
Oh, I'm sorry, we weren't.

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:48.819
Really, one more time would be great.

00:01:49.439 --> 00:01:50.140
That's it for today.

00:01:54.109 --> 00:01:57.370
What do you say you come in bright and early Monday morning and give it another world?

00:01:57.849 --> 00:02:02.680
